index.html:180:  <script src="app.js"></script>
exit 0
Explanation: only the external <script src="app.js"> remains. All inline <script>...</script>
was extracted to app.js so the strict CSP (script-src 'self') does not block any functionality.
No 'unsafe-inline' is needed for script-src — the inline JS is gone, not nonce'd.

