SUMMARY — all 9 verify checks passed (exit 0)
==============================================================

A11y changes (index.html)
  - refresh button: added type="button", aria-label="刷新文章列表"
  - status region: added role="status", aria-live="polite" so screen readers announce updates
  - tab buttons: added type="button", role="tab", aria-selected, aria-controls
  - tabs container: added role="tablist", aria-label
  - articleList: added role="tabpanel", aria-live="polite"
  - focus-visible: added explicit button:focus-visible / a:focus-visible outline so keyboard
    navigation is clearly visible (does NOT disappear on Tab)
  - showTab() now toggles aria-selected in sync with the .active class

XSS hardening (index.html + app.js)
  - extracted all inline <script> to app.js
  - renderArticle → buildArticleElement: uses createElement + textContent for all user-derived
    values (title, board, author, date, pushes, url). No innerHTML anywhere.
  - All <a href> go through .href (URL setter), not innerHTML concatenation.
  - Status text uses status.textContent = ... (not innerHTML).

CSP / security headers (vercel.json — rewrites preserved untouched)
  - Added headers section under source: "/(.*)".
  - Content-Security-Policy:
      default-src 'self';
      script-src 'self';
      style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline';
      img-src 'self' data:;
      font-src 'self';
      connect-src 'self';
      object-src 'none';
      base-uri 'self';
      frame-ancestors 'none';
      form-action 'self'
  - X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  - Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  - X-Frame-Options: DENY

Style-source 'unsafe-inline' rationale (M5 follow-up): the inline <style> block lives in
index.html for self-containment. Strictly removing it would require a separate .css file +
adjusting the Vercel rewrites for /css/*, which crosses into devops territory and is out of
scope for M2. Tracked as a known-issue follow-up for M5.

Rewrites preserved (untouched):
  [
    { source: "/api/tracker", destination: "/api/tracker.js" },
    { source: "/(.*)", destination: "/index.html" }
  ]

